  "description": "Certificate of Lawful Development Proposed: Conversion of an existing dwellinghouse (Use Class C3) into a house in multiple occupation (HMO) (Use Class C4) for occupation of up to a\nmaximum of 6no. persons (application for a Certificate of Lawful Development for a Proposed Use)\nPartial demolition of a small single storey addition, together with minor fenestration alterations to facilitate the change of use.&nbsp;",
