    "The proposed use of the dwellinghouse as a House of Multiple Occupancy for up to 6 persons (Use Class C4) is within the tolerances of Class L of Part 3 of Schedule 2 of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).",
